{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14541","headline":"宫词 · 戴叔伦","name":"宫词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫禁迢迢宫漏鸣，夜深无语独含情。\n春风鸾镜愁中影，明月羊车梦里声。\n尘暗玉堦綦迹断，香飘金屋篆烟清。\n贞心一任蛾眉妒，买赋何须问马卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}